{"schema_version":1,"id":"d59f2nf3osn8","type":"work","title":"楊全甫諫草","authors":[{"name":"楊天民","role":"撰","dynasty":"明","entity_id":"hixhd2h9bmz8"}],"indexed_by":[{"source":"欽定四庫全書總目","source_bid":"d59dh3vo9af4","title_info":"《楊全甫諫草》•四卷","author_info":"明楊天民撰","summary":"明楊天民撰。天民號全甫，山西太平人，萬曆己丑進士，官至禮科右給事中，降永從縣典史，後贈光祿寺少卿，事蹟具《明史》本傳。天民在諫垣，敢於言事。建儲之疏至十二上，卒以是謫死。其鄉人為梓先後疏稿共成四卷，後附《贈官制》及《諭祭文》。贈官在天啟二年九月，諭祭在三年十月。而卷首《許維新序》作於天啟元年十一月，已有“台臣請加恤錄”之語。蓋奏請在前，得允在後耳。","edition":"山西巡撫采進本"},{"source":"續修四庫全書","source_bid":"d59f2og4vksh","title_info":"《楊全甫諫草》四卷","author_info":"明楊天民撰","summary":"《楊全甫諫草》四卷。明楊天民撰。影印天津圖書館藏明天啟刻本。","edition":"影印天津圖書館藏明天啟刻本","volume":"第482冊","section":"史部 史部"},{"source":"四庫全書存目叢書","source_bid":"d59f2og4vke9","title_info":"《楊全甫諫草》四卷","author_info":"明楊天民撰","summary":"《楊全甫諫草》四卷。明楊天民撰。北京圖書館藏明刻本。","edition":"北京圖書館藏明刻本","volume":"第64冊","section":"史部"}],"juan_count":{"number":4},"resources":[{"id":"shidianguji-keben","name":"识典古籍","url":"https://www.shidianguji.com/book/CADAL02048122","metadata":{"edition":"刻本","version":"v2","total_page":373,"paragraph_count":2830,"check_type":"AI整理"},"types":["text","image"]},{"id":"shidianguji-tianqiyuankeben","name":"识典古籍","url":"https://www.shidianguji.com/book/HY2226","metadata":{"edition":"天啓元年(1621)刻本","version":"v1","total_page":398,"paragraph_count":3344,"check_type":"AI整理"},"types":["text","image"]},{"id":"shidianguji-tianqikeben","name":"识典古籍","url":"https://www.shidianguji.com/book/CADAL02082988","metadata":{"edition":"天啓刻本","version":"v1","total_page":373,"paragraph_count":3154,"check_type":"AI整理"},"types":["text","image"]},{"name":"Internet Archive","id":"internet-archive","url":"https://archive.org/details/02082988.cn","types":["image"]},{"id":"wikimedia-commons-xuxiu","name":"維基共享 續修四庫全書 PDF","short_name":"維基共享","url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E7%BA%8C%E4%BF%AE%E5%9B%9B%E5%BA%AB%E5%85%A8%E6%9B%B8%E7%AC%AC0482%E5%86%8A.pdf","metadata":{"volume":482},"types":["image"]},{"name":"维基共享资源","type":"image","id":"com